Z||000003||Raydar||11-24-2001||07:10 PM||||Saw a cartoon once...<BR>Guy had put a "Honk if..." bumper sticker on his car.<BR>While he was sitting at a redlight, someone saw it and honked.<BR>The guy leaned out his window all the way to his waist and shouted to the guy behind him, "You dumb SOB! Can't you see the light's still red?!"<P>Raydar &lt;ducking the lightning bolts&gt; ||||reg||1
